> On May 8, 2025, at 4:05=E2=80=AFAM, RFC Errata System=20
> <rfc-editor@rfc-editor.org> wrote:
>
> The following errata report has been submitted for RFC8446,
> "The Transport Layer Security (TLS) Protocol Version 1.3".
>
> --------------------------------------
> You may review the report below and at:
> https://www.rfc-editor.org/errata/eid8411
>
> --------------------------------------
> Type: Technical
> Reported by: Albin Johansson <albin.johansson@vector.com>
>
> Section: 4.2.7
>
> Original Text
> -------------
> struct {
>    NamedGroup named_group_list<2..2^16-1>;
> } NamedGroupList;
>
> Corrected Text
> --------------
> struct {
>    NamedGroup named_group_list<2..2^16-2>;
> } NamedGroupList;
>
> Notes
> -----
> The specified maximum legal length of the named_group_list=20
> vector in the NamedGroupList structure is 2^16-1 bytes. This is=20
> invalid because NamedGroup is an enum that occupies two bytes,=20
> but 2^16-1 is not an exact multiple of the element size (2=20
> bytes), as required in Section 3.4. It appears that the intended=20
> upper bound should be 2^16-2 bytes instead.
>
